# ── Added for GitHub release (2026-06) ──
# Bulk media + traces (regenerable via scripts/run/rerender_*.py); KEEP the
# curated showcase videos under autoadapter_bench/results/*/videos/.
**/recordings/
**/task_traces/
**/traces/
# Per-case raw physics traces from integration diagnostics stay local.
# Keep compact results, metrics, generated drivers and model-call records visible.
/autoadapter_bench/diagnostics/**/trace.json
*.mp4
# Keep ONLY curated showcase/verified demos in git (a few dozen); the ~1090
# per-task eval videos (model_axis/, self_axis/) go to the HuggingFace dataset.
!autoadapter_bench/results/**/videos/**/*showcase*.mp4
!autoadapter_bench/results/**/videos/**/DEMO*.mp4
!autoadapter_bench/results/**/videos/**/*_verified.mp4
!autoadapter_bench/results/**/videos/**/driver_demo_*.mp4
# Backups / archived synth attempts
**/_*_backup*/
**/_ARCHIVED_*/
**/*_v1_*backup*/
# Superseded/stale results (kept locally for provenance, not in release)
**/_superseded/
# Defensive: never commit credentials (none currently in repo — verified)
credentials
*.pem
*.key
.aws/
.env.*
